  "status": "Complete: exact vector Q4_K unpacking, exact/reference checks, one Inkling timing and shared-engine regression passed",
  "implementation": [
    "Add an explicit eight-lane Q4_K nibble kernel inside the existing generic decoder, reusing its six-bit scale extraction and sub-block scale/minimum calculation",
    "Select the kernel only in the wide instance via a private generic formal; the plain instance and hardware fallback keep the original scalar loop",
    "Unpack low/high nibbles from each group of eight bytes and produce both 32-value sub-blocks using the existing layout and exact binary32 arithmetic",
    "For finite half scales, the scale*factor*nibble product needs at most 21 significand bits and every nonzero product stays in the normal binary32 exponent range; fused subtraction rounds only the same final subtraction as the scalar path",
    "Retain compiler contraction-off policy, block bounds checks, target mapping, matrix reductions, physical weights and session state; no additional persistent allocation, runtime or threads"
  ],
  "changed_source_files": [
    "src/library/model_runner-quantization.adb",
